 Nijmegen to Kleve by car, such that Kita would be able to get there.; This  recording was made to generate a freely available test resource including speech and gestures. The annotations were created by Peter and Kita who is gesture researcher at the MPI for Psycholinguistics.; Diese Aufnahme wurde erzeugt, um eine frei verfügbare Test Resource zur Verfügung stellen zu können, die Sprache und Gestik umfasst. Die Annotationen wurden von Peter und Kita, dem Gestik Researcher am MPI erzeugt.','route description to Kleve','https://hdl.handle.net/1839/00-0000-0000-0009-294C-9',1,1100,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1374,NULL,'Hoe komt het lief, als ick u lipjes / Raack? en kleve aan de tipjes','http://hdl.handle.net/10744/mi_554865ef-5f8a-4280-bab5-c8ea804109de',1,1100,1,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1375,NULL,'Geplante Aufnahmeaktion','http://hdl.handle.net/10932/00-01B9-0500-4E1E-8401-8',1,1100,2,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1376,NULL,'Sprecher 3891 aus dem Korpus \"Deutsche Mundarten: Zwirner-Korpus\" des AGD am IDS Mannheim','http://hdl.handle.net/10932/00-01B9-1011-FF5C-F601-C',1,1100,3,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1377,NULL,'Sprecher 3892 aus dem Korpus \"Deutsche Mundarten: Zwirner-Korpus\" des AGD am IDS Mannheim','http://hdl.handle.net/10932/00-01B9-1012-49FC-F801-C',1,1100,4,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1378,NULL,'Sprecher 3900 aus dem Korpus \"Deutsche Mundarten: Zwirner-Korpus\" des AGD am IDS Mannheim','http://hdl.handle.net/10932/00-01B9-1014-C18D-0801-F',1,1100,5,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1379,'The **EuroParl-UdS** corpus is a parallel corpus consisting of parliamentary debates of the European Parliament containing texts filtered based of native speakers. It is presently available for English, German and Spanish and the data is in plain text format. It contains texts of the European Parliament that were produced between 1999-2017. More specifically it consists of parallel (sentence-aligned) corpora for English into German and English into Spanish, where the source side contains texts only by native English speakers, and comparable monolingual corpora for English, German and Spanish, containing texts only by native speakers of each language.','EuroParl-Uds','http://hdl.handle.net/21.11119/0000-0000-D5ED-5',1,1101,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1380,NULL,'HABE-IXA testua','https://b2drop.eudat.eu/s/3P9zMGDxTmWCKpH',1,1102,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL),(1381,NULL,'The Life of Charlotte Brontë','https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14106/3094@format=cmdi',1,1103,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1382,NULL,'Wuthering Heights','https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14106/3144@format=cmdi',1,1103,1,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1383,NULL,'Agnes Grey','https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14106/3072@format=cmdi',1,1103,2,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1384,NULL,'The tenant of Wildfell Hall','https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14106/3073@format=cmdi',1,1103,3,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1385,NULL,'Jane Eyre / by Charlotte Bronte [sic]','https://hdl.handle.net/20.500.14106/2001@format=cmdi',1,1103,4,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1386,NULL,'Biographie: Multatuli','https://vlo.clarin.eu/data/clarin/results/cmdi/TextGrid_Repository/textgrid_ssrv_0.xml',1,1104,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1387,NULL,'Wat is de toekomst? (Uit \"Vorstenschool\" van Multatulie)','http://hdl.handle.net/10744/mi_8261a509-c838-49c2-99e8-b69b2aea15b1',1,1104,1,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1388,NULL,'46. De verliefde nachtuil','http://hdl.handle.net/10744/mi_08524f1a-fc5c-4512-ae08-993e3034d0eb',1,1104,2,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1389,'Hizkuntza ikasleen azterketak bildu ditugu. Europar markoko B2 eta C1 mailetako probak dira, sail bakoitzetik 20 ale. Horiek etiketatu eta ondoren esleitutako etiketekin analisi bat egiten saiatu gara. Azterketa hauen balioa neurtzeko ahalegin bat d