 1 megabyte in size when uncompressed; date information is not available for individual articles, but the general period of the collection is 1993).\n\nThe approximate amounts of data per source (when uncompressed…','Spanish News Text','https://vlo.clarin.eu/data/others/results/cmdi/The_LDC_Corpus_Catalog/oai_www_ldc_upenn_edu_LDC95T9.xml',1,1124,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1464,'The collection contains all 16.407 of Arthur Schnitzler\'s diary entries, written between 1879 and 1931, encoded in XML/TEI and sorted by year. The entries are supplemented by an index of persons, works and places.','Arthur Schnitzler Tagebuch (1879-1931)','https://hdl.handle.net/21.11115/0000-000E-0FF1-2',1,1125,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://arche.acdh.oeaw.ac.at',NULL),(1465,NULL,'Arthur Schnitzler Tagebuch (1879-1931)','https://arche.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/browser/oeaw_detail/111841',1,1125,1,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(1466,'XML/TEI, 11017','Dienstag, 18. November 1879 (Schnitzler Tagebuch Digital)','https://hdl.handle.net/21.11115/0000-000B-DD17-3',1,1127,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://arche.acdh.oeaw.ac.at',NULL),(1467,NULL,'Eintrag 18. November 1879','https://arche.acdh.oeaw.ac.at/browser/oeaw_detail/111845',1,1127,1,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(1468,'Historical German text source (16th—19th c.) digitized for the Deutsches Textarchiv (German Text Archive) collection according to the TEI-P5 guidelines.','Die deutsche Frauenbewegung; Eine Betrachtung über deren Entwicklung und Ziele','http://hdl.handle.net/21.11120/0000-000B-D250-D',1,1128,0,NULL,NULL,0,'https://vlo.clarin.eu',NULL),(1469,NULL,'deutsche Frauenbewegung','https://vlo.clarin.eu/record/http_58__47__47_hdl.handle.net_47_21.11120_47_0000-000B-D250-D?1&count=4675&fq=languageCode:code:deu&fq=collection:Deutsches+Textarchiv+%281600%E2%80%931900%29&fqType=languageCode:or&fqType=collection:or&index=0',1,1128,1,NULL,NULL,1,NULL,NULL),(1470,NULL,'CLARIN Resource Families','https://www.clarin.eu/resource-families',1,1129,0,NULL,NULL,0,NULL,NULL),